{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, what you need to do is to summon soldiers to fall from the sky and eliminate the enemy in an instant when your people's lives are hanging by a thread</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/extras/chapter1_1.gif?t=1740834548\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You need to combine soldier cards and effect cards in a reasonable way to summon soldiers with various effects to deal with various situations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/extras/chapter2_1.gif?t=1740834548\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can also use magic cards to restrain enemies and work together with other cards to more efficiently eliminate them</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/extras/chapter3_3.gif?t=1740834548\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3539290?t=1740834548","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1740834548","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/47127da65090bca61d0ecd44e4c93555ae7acd84/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1740834548","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3539290/47127da65090bca61d0ecd44e4c93555ae7acd84/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1740834548","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, w